# SCRLOC.C: the location tree, form, contents and pick list (MO_).
# W=74 list box title: VID_COLS - 6
520 MO_TITLE Locations
# W=78 tree header: VID_COLS - 2 (the pick list shows SCR_LT_PICKW)
521 MO_HDR  Name                                   Type               Code       Capacity

522 MO_EMPTY No locations
# ^1 and ^2 are a location's name, of up to LINK_LOCNAMELEN characters.
523 MO_DELQ Delete location ^1?
524 MO_DELETED Location ^2 deleted
525 MO_ADDED Location ^2 added
526 MO_SAVED Location ^2 saved
527 MO_MOVED Location ^2 moved
# The form's title with the location's name, cut at FORM_TITLEMAX.
# W=40 form title: FORM_TITLEMAX
528 MO_FTITLE Location ^1
# W=66 form box title: the box's width less 6
529 MO_NEWTITLE New location

530 MO_NOITEMS No items in this location
# W=54 pick list title: PK_W - 6
531 MO_PICK Choose a location
532 MO_MOVETO Move into
# The lead rows of a pick list, also the path shown for no location.
# W=56 pick list row and path: SCR_LF_PATHW
533 MO_NOLOC (no location)
534 MO_TOP (top level)
# W=42 status-line information, ^1 one of MO_S_ALL and MO_S_TOP, ^2 one
# of MO_S_HERE and MO_S_BELOW: TUI_ST_INFOW
540 MO_SHOW Showing: ^1, ^2
541 MO_S_ALL all items
542 MO_S_TOP not installed
543 MO_S_HERE this location
544 MO_S_BELOW everything below
# W=12 form labels: LF_VCOL - 1 - 1
545 MO_L_NAME Name
546 MO_L_TYPE Type
547 MO_L_INSIDE Inside
548 MO_L_WHERE
549 MO_L_CODE Code
550 MO_L_CAP Capacity
551 MO_L_NOTES Notes
# W=79 key hints: VID_COLS - 1, level digits not counted
552 MO_HINT Enter=Contents 2Ins=New 2Ctrl-E=Edit 2Del=Delete Esc=Back F1=Help
553 MO_HINTEDIT Enter=Save F4=List Esc=Cancel F1=Help
# W=56 memo box title: MEMO_TITLEW
554 MO_NOTES Notes of location ^1

555 MO_NOSUCH No location ^1
# W=56 pick list row and path: SCR_LF_PATHW
556 MO_ALLLOC (every location)
557 MO_INSELF A location cannot go inside itself
# ^1 is a location's name, of up to LINK_LOCNAMELEN characters.
558 MO_TOODEEP No location can go inside ^1: it is at the deepest level
# ^1 is a location's name, of up to LINK_LOCNAMELEN characters, or a
# lead row's text.
559 MO_PICKQ The list did not reach the current location. Choose ^1?
